  "title": "Fuzzing Enterprise-Grade Blockchain Systems: Industrial Practice and Solutions",
  "abstract": "Blockchain has been widely adopted across diverse sectors. Yet, enterprise-grade systems remain vulnerable to critical flaws that undermine stability and security. Although academic fuzzing tools such as LOKI and Tyr have shown effectiveness in detecting such issues, their integration into industrial practice remains challenging.",
